name: Frozen plan summary and Map-to-Scan navigation preserve the operator choices
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_scan.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: plan map
require-live-snap: 25 Gather repo context | original-map-picker
keys: Up Space
live-snap: map-selection
keys: Right
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | picker-scan-study
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Gather repo context | preserved-map-picker
expect: RUN      Attach reference files
submit: workbench
submit: plan scan
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | bounded-discovery
expect: Discovery passes
expect: Workers
expect-not: Credentials
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_scan.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | engine-choice
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Space
require-live-snap: 20 [x] agentic | selected-engine
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Engine choices updated | applied-engine
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Omit threat-model context | explicit-context-choice
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for this study | explicit-omission
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | frozen-discovery
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_scan.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepared
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 15 Total calls | total-calls-editor
type: 5
keys: Enter
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 15 Protected review | protected-review-editor
type: 2
keys: Enter
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | unapproved-allowance
expect: Repository: repository
expect: Scan: 3 passes
expect: 1 worker(s)
expect: Engines: agentic
expect: Scope: whole repository
expect: Threat context: explicitly omitted
resize: 160x48
live-snap: scan-plan-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: scan-plan-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: scan-plan-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: scan-plan-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW PLAN | scan-plan-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: scan-plan-40x12-details
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | scan-plan-40x12-last-terms
ask: Does approval lead with the frozen repository, scope, engines, context and worker workload, keep every spending term reachable, and preserve the Map selection through the finite Scan detour?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 10 PLAN A STUDY | cancelled-allowance
expect-not: Preparing the selected action
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 10 Viewing Map | returned-origin
expect-not: PLAN A STUDY
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | retained-map-choice-exit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: plan scan
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | restarted-plan
expect-not: Credentials
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/guided_scan.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepared
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
